{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっきまで\nメンバーとごはん食べてたよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やらなきゃいけないことがあって\n先に帰ってるよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒い\n寒い\n真っ赤なお鼻のトナカイさんなう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもみんなの笑いもの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや\nそれくらいのギャグセンが欲しい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トナカイさんに憧れる年頃。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( °_ゝ°)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミスドでいつも食べるのある？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nいつもってのはないかな〜\nこないだポン・デ・リング生 食べた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前記事の写メの髪型はどうなってるの？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n写ってない方の肩に\n髪を流してるだけなんだ(゜ロ゜)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい、ここまで\n今日の3時ころ書きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごはん食べたってのも\nお昼ご飯の話(゜ロ゜)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"更新忘れてた(´・ω・`)\n遅くなりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/01/27/9038267/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/01/27/9038267/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写メないよ(´・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仕事があったときまた撮るね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また内容薄くてごめんなさい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(